{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/978440-compatibility-problems-with-20th-anniversary-game-crossing-over-with-2nd-ed-wraith","id":978440,"title":"Compatibility Problems with 20th Anniversary Game Crossing Over with 2nd ed Wraith?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Wraith: The Oblivion"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-29T08:59:47-07:00","id":978440,"title":"Compatibility Problems with 20th Anniversary Game Crossing Over with 2nd ed Wraith?","content":"I'm setting up a campaign using the 20th anniversary rules (Mage/Vampire/Werewolf) and one of my players is interested in playing a character who has returned from the dead a la Highlander/The Crow.<br /> <br /> Are the 2nd edition Wraith rules, which I've never even looked at, sufficiently compatible with the 20th anniversary rules that they could be used in a mixed campaign?<br /> <br /> i.e. Should I buy 2nd edition Wraith or tough it out for the 20th anniversary?<br /> <br /> Alternatively does anyone have any 'canon' suggestions for such a type of character?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11490-dogstar","name":"Dogstar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11490_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-29T11:40:10-07:00","id":978509,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dogstar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/978440-compatibility-problems-with-20th-anniversary-game-crossing-over-with-2nd-ed-wraith#post978440\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm setting up a campaign using the 20th anniversary rules (Mage/Vampire/Werewolf) and one of my players is interested in playing a character who has returned from the dead a la Highlander/The Crow.<br /> <br /> Are the 2nd edition Wraith rules, which I've never even looked at, sufficiently compatible with the 20th anniversary rules that they could be used in a mixed campaign?</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty much. A few tweaks and slight revision, and you're good.<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> i.e. Should I buy 2nd edition Wraith or tough it out for the 20th anniversary? </div> </div> </div>Yes. To both. <i>2nd</i> is pretty cheap and <i>20th</i> is going to be massive and all-inclusive.<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Alternatively does anyone have any 'canon' suggestions for such a type of character? </div> </div> </div>What you're looking for are <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/250/The-Risen?it=1&amp;filters=0_0_1800_0_0\" target=\"_blank\">The Risen</a>, though I suggest maybe maybe using a <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/36196-wr20-risen-the-vampire-physical-disciplines\">different system</a> to represent their <a href=\"http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Risen\" target=\"_blank\">physical advantages</a> - unless you're using <i>V20</i> and don't want to fiddle around with stuff.<br /> <br /> Cheers!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you don't use an Oxford comma, I feel bad for you, son,<br /> 'Cuz I got ninety-nine problems, but clarity ain't one.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/408-nothing","name":"nothing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar408_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-30T11:37:02-07:00","id":979171,"title":"","content":"Thanks, that looks pretty good and allows me to give my player some choice - he could be a Ghoul hunter, an immortal mage swordsman, or a risen revenant seeking revenge","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11490-dogstar","name":"Dogstar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11490_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-01T14:15:09-07:00","id":979845,"title":"","content":"Yeah, the rules worked mostly fine for Wraith. Not much to fix.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T09:48:02-07:00","id":985478,"title":"","content":"I'd say that, unless you are really going to go full-on into the Underworld aspects, going with the above rules set linked will work just fine. My experiences with <b>Wraith: the Oblivion</b> is that it does not work great in cross-over because the milieu, the mechanics, and the basic premise conceits are SO focused on the restless dead as to force a LOT of cherry picking to work with other systems. That is, you kinda need to be well acquainted (read: an expert) with <b>Wraith</b> \u2013 and perhaps equally so with your 'native' system \u2013 in order to know <i>which</i> parts to 'port over' from <b>Wraith</b>. It's not impossible, mind you, but it's difficult even when it works well.<br /> <br /> ...If you made it through all of that, sorry for the wordiness. Short version: Go with the simplest rules you can find until they don't work for you anymore. Maybe I should'a started with that? Maybe. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>B.I.G. Bird spreads the word: Anybody with a heart votes love<br /> <a href=\"https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/</a></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/409-phaolan","name":"Phaolan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar409_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"478"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T00:58:33-07:00","id":986623,"title":"","content":"Other option are the oriental vampires, the kue-jin.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}